== (B) Fourier coefficient of g(.,delta) at 2l 1_T for class-C networks ==
  max |ghat(2l 1_T) - (1/2) conj(beta_(l,T)) (1 - rho^(-l d))| = 7.52e-16  (nonzero factor for d != 0)
== (C) violating (i)/(ii)/(iii) lowers gamma(.;1) strictly ==
  DC on one factor              : gamma/gamma_opt = 0.952361
  leak plane                    : gamma/gamma_opt = 0.966076
  unequal factor norms          : gamma/gamma_opt = 0.997973
  rotate one atom phase         : gamma/gamma_opt = 0.893187
  drop one neuron (interference): gamma/gamma_opt = 0.329571
